    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know what people say about \"moving on\" but it doesn't feel real. some things are just too broken to fix. it's not just a mistake, it's who i am. how can anyone actually look at me and see something worth keeping around? it feels like the world would just be lighter and better if i wasn't taking up space.",
